# Ask India

Tagline: **Turn questions into evidence.**

This is an RTI Online **citizen POC** (Central public authorities only). It is not Civic Intelligence and not an official government product.

Before implementing anything:

1. Read `.internal/rti/README.md` and `.internal/rti/MASTER.md`
2. Read `.internal/rti/AGENT-LEDGER.md` (what previous agents actually did)
3. Read the assigned `.internal/rti/PHASE-*.md`
4. After the run, append a dated entry to the ledger and write `notes/Phase-<N>-implemented.md` if a phase finished

Do not invent government APIs, scrape RTI Online, or drop the demo/synthetic labeling.
